{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1524,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbb6d0fdb18f246c3530a195",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "懂得踏实有多重要……\r\n正因为您是这样的人，\r\n我才能信任。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b83d5c0bf81ec4e37cd558754a4d37b904303ff403cf66760ff3b623bbc6709d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44e447943c7f45787a827982",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也许是价值观相近吧。\r\n和您在一起，即使什么都不做\r\n也能放松下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbd551f055c8c5a9f4d432871a934e040abb3a2b5d971ce3b26d3adab2d78750",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cac491dbae15d820a8bff7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果在海边看到强击同学，\r\n请告诉我。我会提醒她先把行李\r\n整理完。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e987efc4d6837f69813ab6934bc4a0f2a98ed2a9f7b2b464021ad52bda002ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f4c79b071ce6deb554da1d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一起延续这份光辉。\r\n将它传递给下一代――",
      "source_fingerprint": "67bebc4c4c79596a29d85f70a545cb73800cffbf322430b6bc02178a7908825f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec8328b39418aac01a7d7d84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从母亲那里继承的东西，\r\n多亏您才能让它绽放光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "057aafbc21dfa923fd619375438dbb3dd44aa364286b926b736f498d33433901",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c972abfbda9c668b89d178ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是平日努力的成果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1c7d4f21c86dc25d7ef69c71329e63c405ce2f5d2066393f56093096ac16941",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:223fe16106d88c65e2322d6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多高的墙，\r\n总有一天都能跨越。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1978a091227657b736ebdf2c7518a8d1f56077b27a30d5f5688c5c2da101bc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3254e1a97daacc6825fa73c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是空中救世主。\r\n会踏实地，不断锻炼下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5a20e70b5ab34c05021023e75e129758f313aa2ceff465077aecba494f1a005",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aef17c74f3274ad3613e9858",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "踏实地、稳步地。\r\n以母亲所传的强项为武器――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e5d67f077f6a065ea78890e49b67f4b20bd7e89e44bb6d7d9b87b5ca1373525",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc132f0a7c813e061fe997aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给予更踏实的支持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e1ea564065507ac9c5b9ac702c915c811fa655848385d5332db5fc1b469e780",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd5f7530eed387e73561bf36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会再进一步，提供超越以往的支援！",
      "source_fingerprint": "705a02d8b244a99fa6d036884dc51af13291833a2ebffb5641cc007d7b467576",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1295ffa6028348b08c08d087",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1549c847d674bffca5b8a80dea6fddd5ebfcad7057e99d588df7830057c80bcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f60d847ef90c002dad967d4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说你总说自己胆小，\r\n但谨慎也是一种美德！若是跟勇敢的\r\n我结合起来…就是完美无缺了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b694f9308a74f163048674b2b5039ffc19c0397d795ea7f1262f72899c240145",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6a79882052b3965fd4c0d79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出门了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a95107359ba3a438b9b1f2f7df2f3ee5e54672fa6c9f4a304d9c32dc1ebbb35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e194b84233fd7184747c63c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9146c0c6337c7f6cc8bbcb2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你就像泰迪熊一样。\r\n软绵绵的，紧紧包容我紧绷的心，\r\n治愈着我…对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fe3781e27eeb8b03496e8530d944686ab2260cb80b21ea0d3c5fe6f81d8e513",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37849a0054d59075013358be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢你的眼睛。虽然宁静平和\r\n…却能敏锐地看透本质。我大概也\r\n已经被你看透了吧…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5424879f3da3c0462052edab715251327ebc3ed2e7c58fe488b5f2e4e4f4682f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83dc10e31566c4dbb53e76f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“一年之计在于春！”真是句好话呢。\n是年初才更要全力以赴——\n那么，登山的准备做好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "90d5940f1d76dabc27ef3c078ecb16aa48867f5bd19957988fcc23a08b817bb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce8bc8c76f2b98f6ccdb3aba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同届的大家一起交换巧克力！我是\n以每个人的印象为主题制作的。\n比如莱茵就是向日葵，之类的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "22eb3e39c9052beea48d0457aacb0b8633cedea09118d77bf6c2a2a2f6b90053",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58a454258f11d7c6c07916e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的话，会在给我的巧克力中\r\n注入怎样的心意呢？信任？羁绊？\r\n还是说…？呵呵，真期待呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2544c2d7cba3a4721fbf14e629c90645a81de86f3f18e16ab132a3c9be6f8526",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c171a3d3b9668a6b63a698d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也向夜空的星星许愿了吗？\r\n明明最闪耀的星星就在眼前？\r\n呐，愿望就由我们两人一起实现吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d302ab6004a57a802bdff3134dfcb62bcf523e66efe9476e3cbce9a786068ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3daf370179d94f35d36081a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我第一次的装扮是公主呢。\r\n妈妈在裙子上缝了好多\r\n珠子…超级cute的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f34a9641c8da0efceaad97980e476fbaa1592c125d5692a8b5f80ff05b1ba49d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:460fb2b05ce46d198d95d3f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姜饼人准备OK！\n我和谋勇的派对，你也要来吗？\n虽然场地是在山里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8af959c2bbfddbbbf7207d868dc1ab82e1c45df6e40780c7f027f44e29a4521",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bd85ee06905a90e0e7c1e08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天你要穿上我送的丑毛衣哦？\n那是竖着对半的雪人图案，\n得我们两个并排站才能凑齐嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "78c0a4b819aecd356c26ba4f835d731c26fd1145ba92c177570e479b4e9250c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d410092acd5ab31643c27c67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Wooo！真有你的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0d96f0c98028f5f95b9edbea7dfd309219ec4359912b5e9ae33623422224bf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8400c184704eb35c2d8154b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有没有什么没做完的事？\r\n想做的事和该做的事\r\n统统利落解决掉吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c909aa7a51ad556e5f5f7fde6be77cb6d01b2346a4f95a004311d5fe5bc5cd8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b65ba5b019a90df8ca55a405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到信了吗？可千万别迟到，\r\n一定要来指定地点哦。否则…\r\n就会错失最棒的时光啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9686ea3b989a865c47211d62d41503067b17d90729894ca714fa185b73c3eb05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:399f471c6c5664faad18af80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了特制的装饰蛋糕哦！\r\n正中间的图案当然是\r\n并跑的我们。这是羁绊的证明♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b069918e566e68b6bbdaf5cd64424ecf67cccac66f43ab13ebecc762ab93bbaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c87c2706a8ac24ab9f32b9b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候爸爸在生日那天给我买了\n只泰迪熊。以前经常一起睡觉呢\n…现在它也是我很重要的朋友哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd2b8d8c5ac1ac36b0bb3f2945711652d093bdd2183e340bacf0f00f4574768d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d4b099c7fd2919bda5542e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的生日派对，你大可\r\n轻松空手过来哦。\r\n——因为你本身就是最好的礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ac11b26c86a40ee156f6faf988465092378e19cb4325b042aae4b36641531fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00f133bb3d971316ea27aa2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hey!Look at this!\r\n有新通知哦。干脆利落地\r\n看一看，弄清楚吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1809f0b3b2a7184fbc1d2d35fa61c4363e0a875e8441c2c3ff96d47ba8fba8e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef789803710b1cd0235f086c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有Present！\r\n里面装了什么呢…\r\nC'mon!打开看看吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "94a21cc7aaf3eb4a8692e29b8dc70cb731cc6c5d6bc7ca063e452a117b495085",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af4f31f0082aa5404449f640",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "You're doing great!\r\n任务完成！\r\n不愧是My best buddy♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4169376805cb5adef7439b09fb03a61f148e25942d7239588e6717dd5f71c46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eff828ad46b62f231ef854f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动马上就开始了！\r\n完美地去解决它吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b25b558dfcba98359ebe2f954aaa53e1ec5b1638358e6c845e58d069498a3472",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be707dec69e576cdc51389e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's go!Chop-chop!\r\n活动可是会赶不上的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aea974a63c5a06bad09fe2addd9954e892d89b3b7f56bef788155b083cbca8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:197f2431f70eab574b49fa2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fbb15d7bd3f4aba7056d31637d455e44ed01f889c91d237437928ab668993d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df2da42b4639e57814b89c8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Nice one!赛马娘名鉴的\r\n等级提升了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "858c0f174562e50f57228b4c1e0dfc69c0e1d71b3bf09df9d7b1bed0f21cd23f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28f9370e94856c503157a456",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽的blue对吧？我很喜欢\r\n原色呢。这颜色能让我\r\n显得更有魅力…你不这么觉得吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "52f16c1a4da88f51085943fd45ade281bc566126c5007f96c432b49b3b388056",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85106c87021c4e421a622f90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和谋勇经常一起\n去买衣服和饰品。\n还会配成一对哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "04425c83e0b0f4d221a34fb39f685dcd4bd41038a4ebc81435751374a27fe125",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6720b865e157c527bc27fa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下个周末？周六和squad去咖啡馆，\r\n周日去BBQ…怎么，找我有事？\r\n那…早上就交给你啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f04ef80e3dc18f4a9ffc0d5da44a07f5102569030ef1dfd16d3e85d810c58c9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05f3356aa5ea2c1c95b9c364",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一场精彩的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9da25e28448e65f3a40020be302737ef36f335ad9cdaa978b1e7fdf4725a2b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ed86797c626529cd4d68343",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，很能干嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c04aacdc58d9fe4c6c77805d1bf64fdbbd4a3c16372755d4f47c42cc6dcfbf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cee22dbf8d199f9bc9c544e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要…！",
